      "<figure class=\"madas-excerpt\"><img src=\"resources/madas/as-pure-f/q10-solution-4.svg\" alt=\"Area of 𝑃𝑄𝐶= 1 2 × 8 2 × 2 = 8 2 √ √ √ Area of 𝑅𝑆𝐶= 1 2 = 1 22 × 8 4 × 8 2 = 2 2 √ √ √ Area of trapezium = 8 2 −2 2 = 6 2, as before.\" style=\"--madas-width:320.0px\"></figure>",
